\\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t} & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the water level is rising at a rate of $8\\,{\\text{m}}^{3}\\text{/hour}.$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397885 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397886 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397885 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397887 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397885 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397888 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397885 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397889 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397885 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397890 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397885 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397885 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397885 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397887 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397885 1080 #uuid "cbaa4a7f-8da9-5213-ac9e-71081f8e7d7b" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397886 1081 "\\frac{1}{4}\\,{\\text{m}}^{3}\\text{/hour}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397886 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397886 1084 #uuid "1af0f327-7957-509c-92ce-f6ccf0ddb3d1" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397887 1081 "8\\,{\\text{m}}^{3}\\text{/hour}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397887 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397887 1084 #uuid "d1f9d50c-d199-5878-9d91-1c601ea5f9a6" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397888 1081 "\\frac{1}{8}\\,{\\text{m}}^{3}\\text{/hour}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397888 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397888 1084 #uuid "e1084c6c-8063-54ae-98d0-49c6dedc72f1" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397889 1081 "10\\,{\\text{m}}^{3}\\text{/hour}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397889 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397889 1084 #uuid "7c656302-c35f-5667-afb2-b24