[17592186397982 1069 "q-123294" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397982 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397982 1071 "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397982 1072 #uuid "cbfe4f27-7d39-5346-b6c3-d28ca1cafdae" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397982 1074 "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int (4{t}^{3}+2)\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\frac{t}{4}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t+{c}_{1},\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397984 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397985 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397986 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397987 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397988 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397983 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397983 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397983 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397986 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397983 1080 #uuid "47e7c65b-0145-5085-9ab2-4dece927cc93" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397984 1081 "⟨{t}^{2}-4t,\\,\\frac{t}{8}⟩+C" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397984 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397984 1084 #uuid "c9e81bae-2705-548d-95b6-765f54a06b64" 1